{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31589","headline":"请告南归留别同馆 · 李羣玉","name":"请告南归留别同馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一点灯前独坐身，西风初动帝城砧。\n不胜庾信乡关思，遂作陶潜归去吟。\n书合乍离情黯黯，彤庭回望肃沈沈。\n应怜一别瀛洲侣，万里单飞云外深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}